{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nPON!見にきてくださって\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PON!のあとは\nミニ握手会に呼んでもらえなかったので←\n美容院行ってきました！\n最近なかなか行ける機会がなくて\nやっと行けた(*^^*)\nすっきり＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、ついでに意味も無く\n渋谷のタワレコとTSUTAYAよったよ(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ\nやっぱ気になるじゃん？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\nタワレコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さんと乃木坂のCDが並んでて\n中田はそのちょっと離れたところで\n「ヲタクじゃないですよ」\nというおももちでさらっと立つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDを手に取る男性"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はさらっと通ってちらっと見る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『それでも好きだよ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...よし、次だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TSUTAYA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも\n指原さんと乃木坂のCDが並んでて\n中田はその裏にあった\nももクロさんのCDを見てるフリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDを2枚手にとる女子大生(仮)二人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はその二人が何を話してるか\n聞きたいが聞きとれない\n横をすかさず通ってちらっとさらっと見る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『それでも好きだよtype-A』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『それでも好きだよtype-B』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいからもう少し粘る←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性きたこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性がCDに手を伸ばした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『おいでシャンプー』きてぁぁ